  "source_state": "Working tree on top of baseline_commit (uncommitted): faster fast/dfast, lazy-family and optimal-parser match finders, one-pass sequence codes and cheaper sequence coding in the encoder; per-length Huffman pair tables, range-typed sequence bit counts and fewer bounds checks in the decoder (CHANGELOG.md, v0.2.1). Includes the btlazy2 long-run fix verified by paired runs. sha256 identifies the measured sources and harness. Cargo.lock hashes are those of the v0.2.1 version bump, which changed only the package version string after the run.",
